</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">where in the second line, we used the following decomposition:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
